【 Construction 】 Logging, mining, gathering, killing monsters, and obtaining various materials. Use your hands, forging table, textile table, grinding table, paper rack, workbench, etc. to make increasingly complex and powerful equipment, weapons, pills, etc. Build bricks and tiles, build houses, use construction hammers and tool hammers to build your defense facilities, deploy and build magnificent and powerful sects!
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/39619490/d06ad63f561531cac3aca3797a222a31b0e1df9a.jpg
【 Combat 】Rich weapons, abundant equipment, powerful treasures, changing spells, rare stones, experience the ever-changing combat system. Explore the world using lightness skills, swordsmanship, stepping on waves, swimming, and turtle breathing techniques, and engage in battles with fierce beasts and other players. Master the true art of combat, make reasonable use of physical strength and magic, dodge, block, and counterattack, and become the most powerful cultivator on the continent!
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/39619490/90dc0f67f91954a0f674759ddd4ea4f205f30551.jpg
More rich and exciting gameplay content, waiting for everyone to enter the Tales experience!

Traveling through the wilderness not only allows you to experience the authentic cultivation content, such as alchemy, weapon refining, spells, treasures, swordsmanship, crossing tribulations, spiritual pets, monsters, secret realms, treasure hunting, etc., step by step from ordinary people to immortal powers;
You can also experience various systems and gameplay of classic sandbox games, collect, build, survive, build, and freely build houses and other buildings, and build your own sect with friends. The high degree of freedom and playability allows every player to do their best to create self satisfying fun in the wilderness.
